      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is easily done.\n• Open your Camera in-game\n   > Scroll to the right and set \"Stream Mode\" Green/Enabled\n• Go to OBS/SLOBS and create (or reuse) a Game Capture\n• Set said Game Capture to VRChat, then wait a moment.\nI do this all the time with my stream, fairly easy and only needs to be done once in OBS. Works with VRChat minimized in VR Mode.",
